Description: SHADOW Arsenal profile - Forensics
 A digital-forensics kit for authorized incident response and investigation:
 imaging and write-safe acquisition, filesystem and deleted-file analysis,
 carving, memory and registry artifacts, malware triage and anti-virus
 scanning. Use these on evidence you are authorized to examine, and keep an
 auditable chain of custody.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the 22 tools of the profile, all from Debian
 main; APT installs every one of them with it.
 .
 Not included, because they are not in Debian main: Volatility 3,
 bulk_extractor, Chainsaw, Hayabusa, Volatility (2.x), NetworkMiner. The
 Arsenal manager lists where their vendors publish them.
 .
 These tools are for authorised security testing, research, defence and
 education only: use them on systems you own or have explicit written
 permission to test, and follow the law that applies to you. They come with no
