Description: SHADOW Arsenal profile - Reverse Engineering
 Static and dynamic analysis of binaries, libraries, firmware and mobile apps:
 debuggers, decompilers, tracers, hex editors, ELF/PE inspection, emulation
 and fuzzing. For malware analysis, run samples only inside an isolated lab
 (see the lab-setup guide). Ghidra, radare2 and Cutter are not in Debian main
 and are listed as external tools with install links.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the 27 tools of the profile, all from Debian
 main; APT installs every one of them with it.
 .
 Not included, because they are not in Debian main: Ghidra, radare2 / Cutter,
 Frida, IDA Free, x64dbg, jadx, objection, MobSF, drozer, capa, FLOSS, PE-
 bear, Detect It Easy, GEF, pwndbg, honggfuzz. The Arsenal manager lists where
 their vendors publish them.
 .
