Description: SHADOW Arsenal profile - Penetration Testing
 A ready-to-go selection of the most-used offensive tools for authorized
 penetration testing: host and service discovery, DNS and SMB enumeration, web
 application testing, password attacks, wireless attacks and traffic
 interception. Every tool here is also part of a category profile; this
 profile groups them under one name for convenience. Proprietary suites (Burp
 Suite Pro, Metasploit Pro, Cobalt Strike) and tools not packaged in Debian
 are listed in the Arsenal with their official sources. Use only on systems
 you own or are contracted in writing to test.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the 43 tools of the profile, all from Debian
 main; APT installs every one of them with it.
 .
 These tools are for authorised security testing, research, defence and
 education only: use them on systems you own or have explicit written
 permission to test, and follow the law that applies to you. They come with no
 warranty.
